{
  "_comment": [
    "The model the inference deployment serves, pinned to one Hugging Face commit, with",
    "every file it needs and how to verify it. scripts/weights.sh reads this file and",
    "nothing else; no model id, revision or hash is written anywhere in scripts/.",
    "",
    "model_id must equal the model_id default in infra/cluster/platform/variables.tf,",
    "because the bucket prefix the init container syncs from is models/<model_id>.",
    "weights.sh checks that before it does anything.",
    "",
    "sha256 is the LFS object hash Hugging Face publishes for large files. git_blob is",
    "the git object id for the small ones, checked with git hash-object. Both were read",
    "from the API URL in source_url on sourced_on; .gitattributes is left out because",
    "vLLM never reads it."
  ],
